    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it, check its properties, move to destination. If not, approach object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectProperties    />\"",
